@baseUrl = http://localhost:4201
@apiVersion = 1
@domain = core
@workflow = otp-auth
@harness = otp-auth-harness

### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### otp-auth SubFlow — senaryo koleksiyonu
###
### Akis:  otp-initializing → profile-lookup →[scopeGroup]→ otp-sending
###          → otp-awaiting-code ⇄ otp-verifying → auth-code-issuing → otp-success
###        SIM bloke (Kurumsal): otp-sending → otp-resending-fast (OtpType=Fast)
###        TTL dolar:            otp-awaiting-code → otp-ttl-gate → otp-awaiting-resend
###
### MockLab fixture'lari (etc/docker/config/seed/otp-auth-collection.json):
###   actor 11111111110  profil var, telefon 5551112233 (eslesir)
###   actor 22222222220  profil var, telefon 5559998877 (ESLESMEZ)
###   actor 33333333330  profil YOK (404)
###   actor 44444444440  SIM bloke: Otp -> OtpBlacklisted, Fast -> SendOtpSuccess
###   actor 55555555550  SERT bloke: Otp da Fast da OtpBlacklisted
###   actor 88888888880  send-otp 500 (teknik hata)
###   actor 99999999990  simple-profile 500 (teknik hata)
###   otpCode 123456 dogru | 000000 suresi dolmus | digerleri yanlis
###   client_id "fail-client" -> authorization-code 400
###
### Seed degistiyse:  docker compose down -v && docker compose up -d mocklab
### ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


### ══ 1) Kurumsal happy path → otp-success ══════════════════════════════════
# @name k1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "9001234567",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "user_email": "ayse.yilmaz@example.com",
  "user_name": "Ayse",
  "user_surname": "Yilmaz",
  "scopeGroup": "Kurumsal",
  "otpAttempt": 3,
  "otpTtl": 180
}

###
@k1 = {{k1.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen state: otp-awaiting-code (view: otp-code-entry-view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k1}}/functions/state

### Dogru kodu gir → auth-code-issuing → otp-success
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: state otp-success, otpAuthResult "success", authorizationCode dolu,
###           client_secret null (IssueAuthorizationCodeMapping temizler)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k1}}/functions/state


### ══ 2) Kurumsal SIM bloke → FAST fallback → otp-success ═══════════════════
### Beklenen iz: send-otp (OtpType=Otp) OtpBlacklisted → simBlocked=true, otpType=Fast
###              → otp-resending-fast → send-otp (OtpType=Fast) SendOtpSuccess
# @name k2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "9001234567",
  "actor": "44444444440",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Kurumsal"
}

###
@k2 = {{k2.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: otp-awaiting-code, simBlocked=true, otpType="Fast"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k2}}/functions/state

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k2}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: otp-success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k2}}/functions/state


### ══ 3) Kurumsal cift bloke → sim-blocked ══════════════════════════════════
### Beklenen: TOPLAM 2 send-otp cagrisi (Otp + Fast), sonra sim-blocked.
###           Ucuncu bir "Otp" denemesi ASLA olmaz — latch bunu engeller.
# @name k3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "9001234567",
  "actor": "55555555550",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Kurumsal"
}

###
@k3 = {{k3.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: state sim-blocked (subType 2), otpAuthResult "sim-blocked"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k3}}/functions/state


### ══ 4) Bireysel happy path → otp-success ══════════════════════════════════
# @name b1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@b1 = {{b1.response.body.id}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{b1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: otp-success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{b1}}/functions/state


### ══ 5) Bireysel profil kaydi yok → profile-not-found ══════════════════════
### Beklenen: send-otp SIFIR cagri
# @name b2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "33333333330",
  "actor": "33333333330",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@b2 = {{b2.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: state profile-not-found, otpAuthResult "profile-not-found"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{b2}}/functions/state


### ══ 6) Bireysel telefon uyusmuyor → phone-mismatch ════════════════════════
# @name b3
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "22222222220",
  "actor": "22222222220",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@b3 = {{b3.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: state phone-mismatch, otpAuthResult "phone-mismatch"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{b3}}/functions/state


### ══ 7) Bireysel SIM bloke → sim-blocked (FAST DENENMEZ) ═══════════════════
### Beklenen: TEK send-otp cagrisi, OtpType="Otp". OtpType="Fast" iceren cagri OLMAMALI.
# @name b4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "44444444440",
  "actor": "44444444440",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@b4 = {{b4.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: state sim-blocked
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{b4}}/functions/state

### Kanit: mocklab loglarinda bu instance icin OtpType=Fast gecen cagri olmamali
###   docker compose logs mocklab | grep -i fast


### ══ 8) Attempt tukenmesi → attempt-exceeded ═══════════════════════════════
# @name a1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel",
  "otpAttempt": 2,
  "otpTtl": 600
}

###
@a1 = {{a1.response.body.id}}

### 1. yanlis kod → attemptUsed 1, otp-awaiting-code'a geri doner
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{a1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "999999" }

### Beklenen: otp-awaiting-code, attemptUsed 1
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{a1}}/functions/state

### 2. yanlis kod → attemptUsed 2 == otpAttempt → attempt-exceeded
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{a1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "888888" }

### Beklenen: state attempt-exceeded, attemptUsed 2
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{a1}}/functions/state


### ══ 9) TTL → manuel tekrar gonderim → otp-success ═════════════════════════
### otpTtl 30 sn. Once bir yanlis kod gir (attemptUsed 1 olsun), sonra TTL'in dolmasini
### bekle. Kritik dogrulama: resend SONRASI attemptUsed hala 1 — sifirlanmamali.
# @name t1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel",
  "otpAttempt": 3,
  "otpTtl": 30,
  "resendLimit": 2
}

###
@t1 = {{t1.response.body.id}}

### Bir yanlis kod — attemptUsed 1
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "111111" }

### ~35 sn BEKLE, sonra: beklenen state otp-awaiting-resend (view: otp-resend-view)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/functions/state

### Manuel tekrar gonderim → resendUsed 1, yeni otpExpiresAt, otp-awaiting-code
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/transitions/resend-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Beklenen: otp-awaiting-code, resendUsed 1, attemptUsed HALA 1 (sifirlanmadi)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/functions/state

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: otp-success
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t1}}/functions/state


### ══ 9b) TTL + tekrar gonderim hakki yok → ttl-expired ═════════════════════
# @name t2
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel",
  "otpTtl": 30,
  "resendLimit": 0
}

###
@t2 = {{t2.response.body.id}}

### ~35 sn BEKLE. Beklenen: state ttl-expired (subType 8), otpAuthResult "ttl-expired"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{t2}}/functions/state

### Alternatif (beklemeden): sunucu tarafi expiry — otpCode "000000" verifyGate=expired uretir
### ve ayni otp-ttl-gate'e girer.


### ══ 10) Kurumsal profil yok → akis DEVAM eder → otp-success ═══════════════
### Kullanici karari: Kurumsal'da profil bilgi amaclidir; kayit yoksa da telefon
### uyusmasa da akis durmaz.
# @name k4
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "9001234567",
  "actor": "33333333330",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Kurumsal"
}

###
@k4 = {{k4.response.body.id}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k4}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: otp-success (profileFound=false ama profileGate="pass")
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k4}}/functions/state


### ══ 11) Auth code reddi → auth-code-failed ════════════════════════════════
# @name f1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "fail-client",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@f1 = {{f1.response.body.id}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{f1}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen: state auth-code-failed, authorizationCode bos
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{f1}}/functions/state


### ══ 12) Teknik hata ayrimi → otp-technical-failure (profile-not-found DEGIL) ══
# @name e1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "99999999990",
  "actor": "99999999990",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@e1 = {{e1.response.body.id}}

### Beklenen: state otp-technical-failure, otpAuthResult "technical-failure"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{e1}}/functions/state


### ══ 13) Iptal → otp-cancelled ════════════════════════════════════════════
# @name c1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@c1 = {{c1.response.body.id}}

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{c1}}/transitions/cancel-otp-auth?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Beklenen: state otp-cancelled (subType 7), otpAuthResult "cancelled"
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{c1}}/functions/state


### ══ 14) SubFlow sozlesmesi — harness parent uzerinden ═════════════════════
### Parent stateType 4 ile otp-auth'u cagirir; ISubFlowMapping sonucu geri tasir.
# @name h1
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{harness}}/instances/start
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sub": "11111111110",
  "actor": "11111111110",
  "client_id": "mobile-banking-app",
  "grant_type": "authorization_code",
  "client_secret": "s3cr3t",
  "user_phone": "5551112233",
  "scopeGroup": "Bireysel"
}

###
@h1 = {{h1.response.body.id}}

### Parent state: harness-otp-auth (child otp-awaiting-code'da bekliyor).
### Child instance id'sini yanittan al ve asagiya yaz.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{harness}}/instances/{{h1}}/functions/state

###
@childId = REPLACE_WITH_CHILD_INSTANCE_ID

###
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{childId}}/transitions/verify-otp?sync=true
Content-Type: application/json

{ "otpCode": "123456" }

### Beklenen parent: harness-success; otpAuthResult "success" ve authorizationCode
### parent instance data'sinda. client_secret ve otpCode parent'a TASINMAMALI.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{harness}}/instances/{{h1}}/functions/state


### ── Yardimci sorgular ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Basariyla sonlanan instance'lar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?state=otp-success

### SIM bloke ile sonlananlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances?state=sim-blocked

### Basarisiz bir transition'i yeniden dene
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v{{apiVersion}}/{{domain}}/workflows/{{workflow}}/instances/{{k1}}/retry
